<title>BELGIUM: EU did not discuss other currencies - Juncker.</title>
<headline>EU did not discuss other currencies - Juncker.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union finance ministers did not discuss any currency other than the Italian lira at their meeting on the exchange rate mechanism on Sunday, Luxembourg Prime Minister Jean-Claude Juncker said.</p>
<p>Asked whether other currencies had been discussed, Juncker, who is also finance minister, told reporters: &quot;No&quot;.</p>
</text>
